      "content": "<p></p><p></p><h2 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><br></h2><p><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Finding the right neighbourhood to rent your next apartment in Bangalore can be an arduous task. The locations Sarjapur and Mahadevapura are two major neighbourhoods for a variety of renters, IT professionals and families in particular. There are many pros and cons of each location regarding connectivity, lifestyle, and affordability! In this blog I will compare the two neighbourhoods of Sarjapur and Mahadevapura regarding factors that you can keep in mind so that you can decide which one is more suited to your needs.<br><br></span></p><h2><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001029027\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b>Table of Contents</b></span></span></h2><ol><li><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">L</span><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">ocation Overview</span></li><li>Connectivity &amp; Infrastructure<br></li><li>Residential options</li><li>Rental Prices</li><li>Social Infrastructure</li><li>Proximity to Employment Hubs</li><li>Planned Infrastructure Developments</li><li>Who Should Choose Sarjapur?</li><li>Who Should Choose Mahadevapura?</li><li>Final Verdict</li><li>FAQs</li></ol><p><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001029027\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><br></span></span></p><p></p><p></p><ol></ol><h2><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001029027\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b>1.Sarjapur vs Mahadevapura: Location Overview</b></span></h2><h3><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br>Sarjapur:</span></h3><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Sarjapur, located in Southeast Bangalore, has quickly become an attractive residential and commercial area. It is best known for its closeness to the major IT corridors such as Electronic City and Outer Ring Road (ORR), thus appealing to the young workforce.</span>&nbsp;<h3><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001029027\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br>Mahadevapura: </span></span></h3><p></p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001029027\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><a href=\"https://www.kots.world/blog/a-complete-overview-of-mahadevapura-bangalore\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">Mahadevapura</span> </a>is located in East Bangalore, neighbouring Whitefield and the IT clusters surrounding it. It is also an established area with residential and commercial projects. Mahadevapura offers a blended urban lifestyle with connectivity.</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocbjc83u7ssyo5\",\"id\":\"toc_l6vuuq1cqi1z\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_l6vuuq1cqi1z\">&nbsp;</span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocbjc83u7ssyo5\",\"id\":\"toc_l6vuuq1cqi1z\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_l6vuuq1cqi1z\">&nbsp;</span></span><p></p><table class=\"table table-bordered\"><tbody><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001029027\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b>Factor</b></span></p></td><td><p><b>Sarjapur&nbsp;</b></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001029027\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b>Mahadevapura</b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001029027\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Location</span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001029027\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Southeast Bangalore</span></p></td><td><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000001029027\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">East Bangalore</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001029027\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Proximity</span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001029027\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Near Electronic City, ORR</span></p></td><td><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000001029027\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Near Whitefield, ITPB</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001029027\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Development</span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001029027\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Rapidly growing</span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001029027\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Well-established</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2 style=\"margin: 18pt 0px 6pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">2.Connectivity &amp; Infrastructure</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocq7kax4eis6nf\",\"id\":\"toc_ze7mi1c4h2me\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_ze7mi1c4h2me\">&nbsp;</span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocq7kax4eis6nf\",\"id\":\"toc_ze7mi1c4h2me\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_ze7mi1c4h2me\">&nbsp;</span></b></h2><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"0pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"></p><h3><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br></span><p><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Sarjapur:</span></p></h3><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Sarjapur is well-connected by roads to Koramangala, HSR Layout, and all the IT clusters on the ORR and Electronic City. Public transit, mostly road-based, is improving steadily with future metro lines (Hebbal-Sarjapur and ORR-Airport) and the Peripheral Ring Road planned to further increase accessibility.</span><p></p><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"0pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span class=\"EOP\">&nbsp;</span></p><h3 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Mahadevapura:&nbsp;<br></span></h3><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"0pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\">Mahadevapura has direct access to Whitefield, Old Airport and ORR. The extended Purple Line of Namma Metro which goes through Mahadevapura to Baiyyappanahalli and across Bangalore. Proximity to companies with BMTC buses makes it a good commuting location.</p><div><br></div><table class=\"table table-bordered\"><tbody><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001029027\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b>Factor</b></span></p></td><td><p><b>Sarjapur</b></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001029027\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b>Mahadevapura</b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000001029027\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Road Connectivity</span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001029027\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Strong links to Koramangala, HSR, ORR</span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001029027\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Direct access to ORR, Whitefield Road</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001029027\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Metro Connectivity</span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001029027\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Proposed Hebbal-Sarjapur line</span></p></td><td><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000001029027\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Purple Line extension to Baiyyappanahalli</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001029027\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Public Transport</span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001029027\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Mainly road-based, improving</span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001029027\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Well-connected via BMTC and metro</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2 style=\"margin: 18pt 0px 6pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">3. Residential Options</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocw0r8wlr3268x\",\"id\":\"toc_gg32ep7he6mq\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_gg32ep7he6mq\">&nbsp;</span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocw0r8wlr3268x\",\"id\":\"toc_gg32ep7he6mq\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_gg32ep7he6mq\">&nbsp;</span></b></h2><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"0pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Both Sarjapur and Mahadevapura have a wide variety of rental options (apartments, villas, and gated communities) across price ranges for all budgets.</span></p><p><br></p><h3>Sarjapur:</h3><p></p><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Primarily has affordable and mid-range <a href=\"https://www.kots.world/bangalore/flats-for-rent-in-sarjapur\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">apartments in Sarjapur</a>. Newer residential developments have been constructed in Sarjapur Road, attracting people looking for modern amenities.<br></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br></span><h3><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Mahadevapura:</span></h3><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp;Mahadevapura has older residential property owners due to a well-established residential complex, including, higher-end <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"><a href=\"https://www.kots.world/bangalore/flats-for-rent-in-mahadevpura\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"\">apartments for rent in Mahadevapura</a> </span>and villas. Looking back at the real estate market in Mahadevapura, it is a mature market and many established builders provide quality properties in an established community.</span><p></p><p></p><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"0pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><br></p><table class=\"table table-bordered\"><tbody><tr><td><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001029027\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b>Factor</b></span></td><td><b>Sarjapur Road</b></td><td><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001029027\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b>Mahadevapura</b></span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001029027\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Property Types</span></td><td><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001029027\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Apartments, villas, budget-friendly</span></td><td><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000001029027\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Apartments, villas, gated communities</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001029027\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Development Stage</span></td><td><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001029027\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Rapidly growing</span></td><td><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001029027\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Well-established</span></td></tr></tbody></table><h2 style=\"margin: 18pt 0px 6pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">4.Rental Prices</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toclbbuic4sp1pu\",\"id\":\"toc_0uakbw52yshq\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_0uakbw52yshq\">&nbsp;</span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toclbbuic4sp1pu\",\"id\":\"toc_0uakbw52yshq\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_0uakbw52yshq\">&nbsp;</span></b></h2><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"0pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Rental prices in both Sarjapur and Mahadevapura are comparatively high due to demand. Sarjapur has more rentable options at affordable price points in general. However, Mahadevapura will be sought after even at premium rent due to proper township infrastructure and the close proximity to many corporate offices.<br></span></p><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"0pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br></span></p><table class=\"table table-bordered\"><tbody><tr><td><p><b>House Type</b></p></td><td><p><span style=\"\" fkgroteskneue=\"\" fallback\",=\"\" ui-sans-serif,=\"\" system-ui,=\"\" -apple-system,=\"\" blinkmacsystemfont,=\"\" \"segoe=\"\" ui\",=\"\" roboto,=\"\" \"helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" arial,=\"\" \"noto=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif,=\"\" \"apple=\"\" color=\"\" emoji\",=\"\" ui=\"\" symbol\",=\"\" emoji\";\"=\"\"><b>Sarjapur</b></span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001029027\" style=\"font-family: fkGroteskNeue, \" fkgroteskneue=\"\" fallback\",=\"\" ui-sans-serif,=\"\" system-ui,=\"\" -apple-system,=\"\" blinkmacsystemfont,=\"\" \"segoe=\"\" ui\",=\"\" roboto,=\"\" \"helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" arial,=\"\" \"noto=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif,=\"\" \"apple=\"\" color=\"\" emoji\",=\"\" ui=\"\" symbol\",=\"\" emoji\";=\"\" color:=\"\" rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0);=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 10.5pt;=\"\" vertical-align:=\"\" baseline;\"=\"\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001029027\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b>Mahadevapura</b></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>1 BHK</p></td><td><p>₹18,000 –₹35,000</p></td><td><p>₹12,000 - ₹18,000</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>2 BHK</p></td><td><p>₹28,000 –₹45,000</p></td><td><p>₹20,000 - ₹30,000</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>3 BHK</p></td><td><p>₹40,000 –₹80,000</p></td><td><p>₹35,000 - ₹50,000</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"0pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br></span></p><p></p><h2><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>5.Social Infrastructure</b></span></h2><p></p><p></p><h3><br>Sarjapur:&nbsp;</h3><p>Sarjapur&nbsp; has&nbsp; notable schools such as<b> Orchids - The International School, and Delhi Public School</b>. Healthcare includes <b>Manipal Hospital and Motherhood Hospital</b>. Premium shopping and entertainment options include <b>Nexus Koramangala Mall, Centro Mall and PNR Felicity Mall</b>.</p><h3><span style=\"font-size: 1.75rem;\"><br>Mahadevapura:</span></h3><p><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"></span></p><p>Mahadevapura has&nbsp; the best schools and colleges such as <b>Vydehi School and Deens Academy</b>. Quality healthcare is available at <b>Manipal Hospital and Aster Whitefield</b>. You also have premium shopping centers nearby such as<b> Phoenix Marketcity Whitefield and VR Mall.<br></b></p><p><br></p><h2><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001029027\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b>6. Proximity to Employment Hubs</b></span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toccljd81ofqbpf\",\"id\":\"toc_ueid7e56f2pi\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_ueid7e56f2pi\"><b>&nbsp;<br></b><br></span></h2><table class=\"table table-bordered\"><tbody><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001029027\" style=\"font-family: fkGroteskNeue, \" fkgroteskneue=\"\" fallback\",=\"\" ui-sans-serif,=\"\" system-ui,=\"\" -apple-system,=\"\" blinkmacsystemfont,=\"\" \"segoe=\"\" ui\",=\"\" roboto,=\"\" \"helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" arial,=\"\" \"noto=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif,=\"\" \"apple=\"\" color=\"\" emoji\",=\"\" ui=\"\" symbol\",=\"\" emoji\";=\"\" color:=\"\" rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0);=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 10.5pt;=\"\" vertical-align:=\"\" baseline;\"=\"\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b>Factor</b></span></p></td><td><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000001029027\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; text-align: center;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"\" fkgroteskneue=\"\" fallback\",=\"\" ui-sans-serif,=\"\" system-ui,=\"\" -apple-system,=\"\" blinkmacsystemfont,=\"\" \"segoe=\"\" ui\",=\"\" roboto,=\"\" \"helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" arial,=\"\" \"noto=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif,=\"\" \"apple=\"\" color=\"\" emoji\",=\"\" ui=\"\" symbol\",=\"\" emoji\";=\"\" text-align:=\"\" left;\"=\"\"><b>Sarjapur</b></span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001029027\" style=\"font-family: fkGroteskNeue, \" fkgroteskneue=\"\" fallback\",=\"\" ui-sans-serif,=\"\" system-ui,=\"\" -apple-system,=\"\" blinkmacsystemfont,=\"\" \"segoe=\"\" ui\",=\"\" roboto,=\"\" \"helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" arial,=\"\" \"noto=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif,=\"\" \"apple=\"\" color=\"\" emoji\",=\"\" ui=\"\" symbol\",=\"\" emoji\";=\"\" color:=\"\" rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0);=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 10.5pt;=\"\" vertical-align:=\"\" baseline;\"=\"\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b>Mahadevapura</b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000001029027\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"font-family: fkGroteskNeue, \" fkgroteskneue=\"\" fallback\",=\"\" ui-sans-serif,=\"\" system-ui,=\"\" -apple-system,=\"\" blinkmacsystemfont,=\"\" \"segoe=\"\" ui\",=\"\" roboto,=\"\" \"helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" arial,=\"\" \"noto=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif,=\"\" \"apple=\"\" color=\"\" emoji\",=\"\" ui=\"\" symbol\",=\"\" emoji\";=\"\" color:=\"\" rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0);=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 10.5pt;=\"\" vertical-align:=\"\" baseline;\"=\"\">IT Parks</span></p></td><td><p>RGA Tech Park,Vaishnavi Tech Park,<br>Global Technology Park</p></td><td><p>ITPB, EPIP Zone,Bagmane Tech Park</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001029027\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Major Companies</span></p></td><td><p>Wipro, Cisco, Accenture</p></td><td><p>IBM, Dell, Oracle</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Commute Times</p></td><td><p>Convenient to ORR IT corridor</p></td><td><p>Close to Whitefield IT hubs</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2 style=\"margin: 18pt 0px 6pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">7.Planned Infrastructure Developments</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocg50x7bzwrbvt\",\"id\":\"toc_qdbvkwjhipq8\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_qdbvkwjhipq8\">&nbsp;</span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocg50x7bzwrbvt\",\"id\":\"toc_qdbvkwjhipq8\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_qdbvkwjhipq8\">&nbsp;</span></b></h2><p></p><h3><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toccljd81ofqbpf\",\"id\":\"toc_ueid7e56f2pi\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_ueid7e56f2pi\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br>Sarjapur:<br></span></span></h3><ul><li><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toccljd81ofqbpf\",\"id\":\"toc_ueid7e56f2pi\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_ueid7e56f2pi\">Metro expansion connecting Sarjapur with other major parts of the city.<br></span></li><li>The Peripheral Ring Road to decongest traffic.<br></li><li>Suburban Railway Corridor for transit speed</li></ul><h3>Mahadevapura:</h3><p></p><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toccljd81ofqbpf\",\"id\":\"toc_ueid7e56f2pi\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_ueid7e56f2pi\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><ul><li>Ongoing metro extension to Baiyyappanahalli and further.</li><li>Road widening and flyover initiatives to eliminate bottlenecks.</li><li>Incorporated into Smart City initiatives to enhance urbanism.</li></ul></span></span><h2><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toccljd81ofqbpf\",\"id\":\"toc_ueid7e56f2pi\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_ueid7e56f2pi\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><br>8.Who Should Choose Sarjapur?</b></span></span></h2><p>Sarjapur is also a great place for people searching for rental housing that is affordable and also has modern facilities. Sarjapur is also a great option for young professionals working in Electronic City or around the Outer Ring Road (ORR) corridor. The main attraction is that Sarjapur is close to tech parks, is connected with metro and has various forms of connectivity being proposed (including road widenings) that is expected to improve over time. Families are attracted to Sarjapur because it is growing residential infrastructure, good schooling options, and expectations for appreciation in the future. While there are some infrastructure challenges, there are many who believe that the trade-offs with those limitations today, is acceptable for longer-term. As Sarjapur features new developments, expanding road networks, and investment continues, Sarjapur provides its residents with all the value, convenience, and potentially strong returns on their rental decisions.<br><br></p><h2><b><br>9.Who Should Choose Mahadevapura?<br></b></h2><p>Mahadevapura is a popular choice for professionals working in Whitefield or other IT parks where young families can commute easily to their work locations. It is also a well-established community with moderate to high-end residential complexes and proximity to top schools and healthcare facilities. Social infrastructure is also well-developed, with several malls, dining options, and entertainment venues typical of urban lifestyles. Renters who are familiar with suburban neighborhoods that prioritize connectivity, commute time and modern living will find Mahadevapura provided everything they are looking for, and a little extra rent is no obstacle. Road access is very good as is access to the metro, and there is an urban energy in the area you can't get in a planned residential neighborhood. As a result, Mahadevapura attracts families and young professionals looking for the higher-end of balanced living in downtown East&nbsp; Bangalore.<br></p><h2><b><br>10.Final Verdict</b></h2><p>Both Sarjapur and Mahadevapura have great options for renting apartments in Bangalore for different reasons.If you are looking for lower rental prices, easy access to Electronic City, and a growing area then Sarjapur may be the suited area to rent in.If you are looking for established infrastructure with luxurious amenities and closer to corporate offices in Whitefield then you likely want to rent in Mahadevapura. Ultimately, your final choice should be based on your budget, the area in which you are working, and your own proposal for lifestyle.&nbsp;</p><h2><b><br>11.FAQs</b></h2><p><b>1: Sarjapur or Mahadevapura? Which area is suited for renting?</b></p><p>Both areas have their strengths and weaknesses. Sarjapur is cheaper and has more growing amenities. Mahadevapura has more established amenities and access to amenities.&nbsp;</p><p><b>2: Is Mahadevapura well connected by public transport?&nbsp;</b></p><p>Yes! Mahadevapura is well connected by public transport (BMTC buses, and the Purple Line Metro extension).</p><p><b>3.Is Sarjapur good for families?</b></p><p>Definitely. Sarjapur has good schools and hospitals, it is great location for families.</p><p><b>4. What are the major infrastructure projects being implemented in Sarjapur?&nbsp;</b></p><p>The metro, Peripheral Ring Road, suburban rail corridors.</p><div><br></div>",
